，达于从政，为汉良吏；初从徐州从事辟司徒府，除卢奴令；冀州举尤异，迁扬州刺史、丹杨太守","evidence":["lvzang-q-2e3fedaf54edb7f3fbf4"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"sunshi-m-o003-sunshi-p0005","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["sunshi-q-o003"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"lvzang-q-10f0a8a1ede4398098fe","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-e2f3b3d6a80ec490e88c","layer":"pei","quote":"还京师，见太尉袁逢。逢问其西域诸国土地、风俗、人物、种数。旻具答言：西域本三十六国，后分为五十五，稍散至百余国。其国大小，道里近远，人数多少，风俗燥湿，山川、草木、鸟兽、异物名种，不与中国同者，悉口陈其状，手画地形。逢奇其才，叹息言：‘虽班固作《西域传》，何以加此？’旻转拜长水校尉，终太原太守","attribution":"裴注·后汉书（谢承）","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3473eb9b61408b668d54","start":99,"end":246,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-2e3fedaf54edb7f3fbf4","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-e2f3b3d6a80ec490e88c","layer":"pei","quote":"旻，有干事才，达于从政，为汉良吏。初从徐州从事辟司徒府，除卢奴令；冀州举尤异，迁扬州刺史、丹杨太守","attribution":"谢承《后汉书》","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3473eb9b61408b668d54","start":13,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-616e6e61dac93def47dc","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-d5bef40364f70827ec99","layer":"original","quote":"父旻，历匈奴中郎将，中山、太原太守〖2〗，所在有名","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-9bc5fca55b7296b8bed9","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-e2f3b3d6a80ec490e88c","layer":"pei","quote":"是时，边方有警，羌胡出寇；三府举能，迁旻匈奴中郎将。讨贼有功，征拜议郎","attribution":"裴注·后汉书（谢承）","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3